{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745720/extras/GifSteam1.gif?t=1748523908\" />The end of the universe. Humanity has disappeared, and the stars have gone out. However, humanity was able to leave something behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The World of Ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is relative in this world, and in the great void, ideas begin to materialize. As one of the self-aware ideas, you strive for the ultimate materialization of the world of ideas, but the battle for it will not be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745720/extras/SteamGif3Opt.gif?t=1748523908\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue Tactics is a turn-based tactical roguelike inspired by games like Kings Bounty and Into the Breach. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes the same content as the full game, but the gameplay is limited to 4 out of 12 worlds, and some unlocks cannot be obtained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a unique squad of creatures with their own strengths and weaknesses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight in deep tactical battles with the impact of landscape on combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine creatures to create stronger ones. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a variety of spells that can turn the tide of battle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find &quot;Ideas&quot; with their unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745720/extras/SteamGif2Opt.gif?t=1748523908\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replayability - procedural generation and a vast amount of content  make each run unique. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of unlockable content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745720?t=1748523908","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745720?t=1748523908","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745720/fd4045e1dbcd6c3ccce38580b121d7b7490e436b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748523908","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745720/fd4045e1dbcd6c3ccce38580b121d7b7490e436b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748523908","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745720/extras/GifSteam1.gif?t=1748523908\" />The end of the universe. Humanity has disappeared, and the stars have gone out. However, humanity was able to leave something behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The World of Ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is relative in this world, and in the great void, ideas begin to materialize. As one of the self-aware ideas, you strive for the ultimate materialization of the world of ideas, but the battle for it will not be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745720/extras/SteamGif3Opt.gif?t=1748523908\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue Tactics is a turn-based tactical roguelike inspired by games like Kings Bounty and Into the Breach. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes the same content as the full game, but the gameplay is limited to 4 out of 12 worlds, and some unlocks cannot be obtained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a unique squad of creatures with their own strengths and weaknesses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight in deep tactical battles with the impact of landscape on combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine creatures to create stronger ones. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a variety of spells that can turn the tide of battle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find &quot;Ideas&quot; with their unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745720/extras/SteamGif2Opt.gif?t=1748523908\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replayability - procedural generation and a vast amount of content  make each run unique. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of unlockable content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Petushock Production"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2345740","name":"Rogue Tactics"},"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745720/651e999a4197cd9cac6ee0f35453f709f88d8733/header.jpg?t=1748523908","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140009,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140009/movie480.mp4?t=1747973848","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140009/movie_max.mp4?t=1747973848"},"name":"Rogue Tactics","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/